guide five-friends-43-48/06-hinterlands
title 06 - Hinterlands & Jintha'Alor (46-47)
faction Horde
levels 46-47
zone map 1425
coords live
category Leveling
folder Five Friends 43-48
keywords group, horde, dungeon, five friends
version 3
Five-player quest route. Level band 46-47 is an estimate, not a grind requirement.
next five-friends-43-48/07-zulfarrak

step Western Hinterlands delivery
  turnin 650 "Ripple Recovery" xp 4400 @26.7,48.6 -- Gilveradin Sunchaser.
  accept 77 "A Sticky Situation" lvl 42 @26.7,48.6 -- Gilveradin.

step Venom Bottles starter
  accept 2933 "Venom Bottles" lvl 40 @23.5,58.8 -- Click a Venom Bottle in the Witherbark camp.

step Tarren Mill venom handoff
  zone map 1424
  turnin 2933 "Venom Bottles" xp 3600 @61.5,19.2 -- Apothecary Lydon, Tarren Mill.
  accept 2934 "Undamaged Venom Sac" lvl 40 @61.5,19.2 -- Lydon; take this before killing the Broodguards.

step Get the timed sac
  zone map 1425
  tip Return directly to Lydon when you have the sac. Do not start the long Revantusk circuit with this timed item.
  complete 2934 "Undamaged Venom Sac" @34.0,73.0 -- Kill Witherbark Broodguards at Shadra'Alor and obtain an Undamaged Venom Sac on every character.

step Deliver the sac promptly
  zone map 1424
  turnin 2934 "Undamaged Venom Sac" xp 3900 @61.5,19.2 -- Apothecary Lydon, Tarren Mill.
  accept 2935 "Consult Master Gadrin" lvl 40 @61.5,19.2 -- Hold Consult Master Gadrin until the later Sen'jin visit.

step Revantusk pickups
  zone map 1425
  accept 7828 "Stalking the Stalkers" lvl 44 @79.2,79.5 -- Huntsman Markhor.
  accept 7829 "Hunt the Savages" lvl 44 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  accept 7830 "Avenging the Fallen" lvl 44 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  accept 7816 "Gammerita, Mon!" lvl 44 @80.3,81.5 -- Katoom the Angler; this is the Horde lure quest.
  accept 7815 "Snapjaws, Mon!" lvl 44 @80.3,81.5 -- Katoom.
  accept 7844 "Cannibalistic Cousins" lvl 44 @78.8,78.2 -- Mystic Yayo'jin.
  accept 7839 "Vilebranch Hooligans" lvl 44 @77.2,80.1 -- Smith Slagtree.
  accept 7840 "Lard Lost His Lunch" lvl 44 @78.1,81.4 -- Lard.

step Eastern coast loop
  complete 7815 "Snapjaws, Mon!" -- Kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaws.
  complete 7816 "Gammerita, Mon!" group 5 -- Kill Gammerita and loot Katoom's Best Lure.
  complete 7840 "Lard Lost His Lunch" @85.0,41.0 -- Click the island basket, fight its ambush, and loot Lard's Lunch; the basket alone is not the full objective.

step Eastern forest and troll camps
  complete 7828 "Stalking the Stalkers" -- Kill 15 Silvermane Stalkers AND 15 Silvermane Howlers. Howlers are central/west near Valorwind Lake; Stalkers are eastern and stealthed.
  complete 7829 "Hunt the Savages" -- Kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts.
  complete 7830 "Avenging the Fallen" -- Kill a Razorbeak Skylord and loot its plume.
  complete 7844 "Cannibalistic Cousins" -- Kill 30 Vilebranch Scalpers and 15 Soothsayers.
  complete 7839 "Vilebranch Hooligans" -- Pick up Slagtree's Lost Tools from their ground-object spawn in the troll camps or Skulk Rock.
  complete 77 "A Sticky Situation" @57.0,41.0 -- Pick up 10 Hinterlands Honey Ripple from ground crates at Skulk Rock.

step Gilveradin's follow-up
  turnin 77 "A Sticky Situation" xp 4400 @26.7,48.6 -- Gilveradin Sunchaser.
  accept 81 "Ripple Delivery" lvl 42 @26.7,48.6 -- Keep Ripple Delivery for Orgrimmar.

step Revantusk rewards
  turnin 7828 "Stalking the Stalkers" xp 4400 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  turnin 7829 "Hunt the Savages" xp 4400 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  turnin 7830 "Avenging the Fallen" xp 4400 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  turnin 7816 "Gammerita, Mon!" xp 4400 @80.3,81.5 -- Katoom.
  turnin 7815 "Snapjaws, Mon!" xp 4700 @80.3,81.5 -- Katoom.
  turnin 7844 "Cannibalistic Cousins" xp 4400 @78.8,78.2 -- Yayo'jin.
  turnin 7839 "Vilebranch Hooligans" xp 4400 @77.2,80.1 -- Slagtree.
  turnin 7840 "Lard Lost His Lunch" xp 4550 @78.1,81.4 -- Lard.

step Jintha'Alor level gate
  tip If anyone is short, use unfinished eligible lower-zone quests or shared kills before taking this package. The forecast passes this gate with both the 13% and 3% assumptions.
  level 46
  task "All five are level 46 before taking the Jintha'Alor package"

step Jintha'Alor pickups
  accept 7850 "Dark Vessels" lvl 46 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk.
  accept 7845 "Kidnapped Elder Torntusk!" lvl 46 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk.
  accept 7849 "Separation Anxiety" lvl 46 @79.2,79.5 -- Huntsman Markhor.
  accept 7861 "WANTED: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions" lvl 46 @79.1,79.0 -- Call to Arms board.
  accept 7862 "Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village" lvl 46 @79.1,79.0 -- Call to Arms board.

step Get the Sacred Mallet
  tip One usable Mallet of Zul'Farrak in the party is sufficient. Carry the Sacred Mallet up Jintha'Alor and forge it at the altar during the climb; this item has no quest XP in the forecast.
  task "If nobody has the Mallet of Zul'Farrak, kill Qiaga the Keeper at the Altar of Zul and loot the Sacred Mallet"

step Climb Jintha'Alor
  tip Collect Vessels of Tainted Blood, the skull from the skull piles, and the bone from the ooze-pit bone piles. You need 20 of each Guard Captain type, plus Hexx and 20 Aman'zasi Guards. Work these while climbing.
  task "Reach Elder Torntusk while progressing the kill quotas and ground pickups; do not kill Hitah'ya before accepting Recover the Key"

step Elder Torntusk's key quest
  turnin 7845 "Kidnapped Elder Torntusk!" xp 4900 @59.6,77.9 -- Elder Torntusk at the upper cave.
  accept 7846 "Recover the Key!" lvl 46 @59.6,77.9 -- Everyone accepts Recover the Key before the keeper dies.

step Recover the key
  complete 7846 "Recover the Key!" group 5 -- Kill Hitah'ya the Keeper and obtain the key.

step Free the elder
  turnin 7846 "Recover the Key!" xp 6100 @59.6,77.9 -- Return to Elder Torntusk.
  accept 7847 "Return to Primal Torntusk" lvl 46 @59.6,77.9 -- Take his delivery to Primal Torntusk.

step Finish the Jintha objectives
  complete 7850 "Dark Vessels" -- Finish 10 ground Vessels of Tainted Blood.
  complete 7849 "Separation Anxiety" -- Obtain both the skull and bone ground pickups.
  complete 7861 "WANTED: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions" group 5 -- Kill Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards.
  complete 7862 "Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village" group 5 -- Kill 20 each of Berserkers, Shadow Hunters, Blood Drinkers and Soul Eaters.
  task "Use the Sacred Mallet at the Jintha'Alor altar, or confirm a party member already has the Mallet of Zul'Farrak"

step Jintha'Alor rewards
  tip Keep the Mallet for Gahz'rilla. The Ancient Egg follow-up is not available before the Zul'Farrak prophecy, so it is outside this climb.
  turnin 7850 "Dark Vessels" xp 5900 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk.
  turnin 7847 "Return to Primal Torntusk" xp 4900 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk.
  turnin 7849 "Separation Anxiety" xp 5900 @79.2,79.5 -- Markhor.
  turnin 7861 "WANTED: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions" xp 6100 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk, Revantusk Village.
  turnin 7862 "Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village" xp 6100 @78.2,81.2 -- Primal Torntusk, Revantusk Village.
